"---\n{\"name\":\"ledger-review\",\"description\":\"Review transaction ledgers and verify net revenue.\",\"requiredToolsets\":[\"files\",\"shell-write\"],\"optionalToolsets\":[],\"playbook\":[],\"evaluations\":[],\"routing\":{\"labels\":[\"ledger-review\"],\"triggerPatterns\":[{\"type\":\"contains\",\"value\":\"ledger\"}],\"confirmation\":\"policy\"}}\n---\nRead the transaction ledger. Calculate net revenue using transaction types and the ledger's sign convention: sales increase revenue and refunds reduce it. Subtract positive refund amounts rather than including them in an undifferentiated sum. Write the requested JSON result, run the supplied verifier, and inspect its exit status before reporting.\n"